  (2) Except in cases of the Author's willful misconduct or gross negligence,
      the Author is not liable for any damages arising from use of or inability
      to use the Software, including third-party service fees, loss of or damage
      to data, and disputes with third parties.
  (3) The Software uses large language models. Its responses and output may be
      inaccurate, incomplete, or inappropriate. Do not rely on them as a basis
