  (4) The Software is a beta version; unexpected behavior, errors, and data loss
      may occur.
  (5) Where liability cannot be excluded entirely under applicable law, the
      Author's liability is limited to the minimum extent permitted by law.


Article 10. Availability

  (1) The Author has no obligation to provide, update, or fix the Software, or
